# Web UI

- Light mode only. Gold wire aesthetic direction (Phase 0 = wireframes).
- Primary Phase 1 workbench: `/design` sandbox. Expand experiments there.
- Preserve writing path (`/`, editor, Muse) while redesigning chrome.
- No dark mode themes or toggles.
- Muse UX: ghost suggestion, Tab accept, other key dismiss.